WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.045 --> 00:00:02.420
JONATHAN CHASE: We've been
working with BigQuery recently

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:05.980
to replace our existing data
in analytics infrastructure.

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:09.460
SADA has been able to help us
get the information we need

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:11.930
or answer the questions that
we've had about Google Cloud

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:12.680
Platform.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:15.850
And this was a big
decision for us.

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:18.550
While it's great that GCP
makes things easy enough

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:21.760
that we can get there on
our own for the most part,

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:23.560
it's great to have
a partner like SADA

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:26.260
that we can call
at any time to help

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:28.030
us get the rest of the way.

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:30.100
The reason that Cedexis
likes Google Cloud

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.800
Platform and BigQuery,
in particular, so much

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.590
is because it makes
things so easy for us

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:36.910
as far as the analytics go.

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:39.220
We've had people dedicated
full time to supporting

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:40.780
our old analytics platform.

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:43.930
And now, those people can work
on more interesting things

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:46.900
than doing operations support
for relational database.

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:48.400
Operating in the
cloud is difficult.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:49.733
It's nice to have good partners.

00:00:49.733 --> 00:00:51.780
It's nice to have a great
platform to work on.

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:53.430
SADA and GCP make that possible.

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:55.580
[MUSIC PLAYING]

